              "ImageDescription": {
                "value": "<br>\n<p><b>Identifier</b>: comprehensivecat00bail (<a class=\"external text\" href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/w/index.php?title=Special%3ASearch&amp;profile=default&amp;fulltext=Search&amp;search=insource%3A%2Fcomprehensivecat00bail%2F\">find matches</a>)<br>\n<b>Title</b>: <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.flickr.com/photos/internetarchivebookimages/tags/bookidcomprehensivecat00bail\">Comprehensive catalogue of Queensland plants, both indigenous and naturalised. To which are added, where known, the aboriginal and other vernacular names; with numerous illustrations, and copious notes on the properties, features, &amp;c., of the plants</a><br>\n<b>Year</b>: <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.flickr.com/photos/internetarchivebookimages/tags/bookyear1909\">1909</a> (<a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.flickr.com/photos/internetarchivebookimages/tags/bookdecade1900\">1900s</a>)<br>\n<b>Authors</b>:  <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.flickr.com/photos/internetarchivebookimages/tags/bookauthorBailey__Frederick_Manson__1827_1915\">Bailey, Frederick Manson, 1827-1915</a><br>\n<b>Subjects</b>:  <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.flickr.com/photos/internetarchivebookimages/tags/booksubjectBotany\">Botany</a><br>\n<b>Publisher</b>:  <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.flickr.com/photos/internetarchivebookimages/tags/bookpublisherBrisbane__A__J__Cumming__government_printer\">Brisbane, A. J. Cumming, government printer</a><br>\n<b>Contributing Library</b>:  <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.flickr.com/photos/internetarchivebookimages/tags/bookcontributorSmithsonian_Libraries\">Smithsonian Libraries</a><br>\n<b>Digitizing Sponsor</b>:  <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.flickr.com/photos/internetarchivebookimages/tags/booksponsorBiodiversity_Heritage_Library\">Biodiversity Heritage Library</a><br>\n<br>\n<b>View Book Page</b>: <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://archive.org/stream/comprehensivecat00bail/comprehensivecat00bail#page/n296/mode/1up\">Book Viewer</a><br>\n<b>About This Book</b>: <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://archive.org/details/comprehensivecat00bail\">Catalog Entry</a><br>\n<b>View All Images</b>: <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.flickr.com/photos/internetarchivebookimages/tags/bookidcomprehensivecat00bail\">All Images From Book</a><br>\nClick here to <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://archive.org/stream/comprehensivecat00bail/comprehensivecat00bail#page/n296/mode/1up\"><b>view book online</b></a> to see this illustration in context in a browseable online version of this book.<br>\n<br>\n<b>Text Appearing Before Image:</b><br>\n<i>68 LXV. COMPOSITE. Rutidosis, DC. helichrysoides, DC. lencantha, F. v. M. Murchisonii, F.v.M. (Fig. 239.)Ammobium, R. Br. alatum, R. Br.Eriochlamys, Sond. et F. v. M. Behrii, S. et M.Phacellothrix, F. v. M. cladochaeta, F. v. M. = Rutidosis Broivnii, Benth.; Helichry-sum cladochcptum, F. v. M.Acomis, F. v. M. Rutidosis, F. v. M. macra, F.v.M. (Fig. 240.) Lesteri, Burkill in Kew Bull. (1901) 140.M)^riocephalus, Benth. rhizocephalus, Benth. Rudallii, Benth. Stuartii, Benth.Angianthus, JVendl. brachypappus, F. v. M. pusillus, Benth.Gnephosis, Cass. arachnoidea, Turcz. cyathopappa, Benth. eriocarpa, Benth.•Calocephalus, R. Br. platycephalus, Benth. citreus, Less. Sonderi, F. v. M. Dittrichii, F. v. M.Gnaphalodes, A. Gray. uliginosum, A. Gray.Craspedia, Forst. Richea, Cass. pleiocephala, F. v. M. chrysantha, Benth. globosa, Benth.Fodolepis, Labill. rhytidochlamys, F.v.M. longipedata, A. Cunn. 1 acuminata, R. Br. canescens, A. Cunn. Siemssenia, F. v. M. Lessoni, Benth. LXV. COMPOSITE. 269</i><br>\n<b>Text Appearing After Image:</b><br>\n<i>f\\che-nQ..